name: open the options window from its HUD button, then close it
# The click opens one of the chat panel's windows (ui_chat_panel.cpp's request 1); its class is a POC stand-in
# (programs/clientpoc/poc_world.cpp: Unknown5CE240Class, an empty window), so the options do not show yet.
expected-fail: the options window is POC stand-in Unknown5CE240Class (0x5CE240, an empty window)
timeout: 400
include _login
alive 8
click gadget hud.options
expect-event stubs '^POC input: replayed mouse 0x202 at 176, 933'
stand-in '^STUB first call: POC Unknown5CE240Class'
alive 4
shot options_open
click gadget hud.options
expect-event stubs '^POC input: replayed mouse 0x202 at 176, 933'
alive 5
